  ('d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001028', 'What geographical term describes the longitudinal structural valleys lying between the Lesser Himalayas and the Shiwalik range?', 'c0000009-0003-0000-0000-000000000075', 'Medium', 'MCQ'),
